-- ============================================================================
-- Migration 1137: the machining workbook's cutting data
-- ============================================================================
-- Generated by scripts/generate-machining-workbook-reference-migration.js from memory/machining/workbook/*.csv; re-run it and diff instead of editing.
--
-- The user's workbook memory/Machining - Calculator Database (1).xlsx times every cutting operation one way: spindle speed
-- n = 1000 v / (pi D), the cut length plus an approach allowance over the feed, times the passes, rounded up to whole seconds per use.
-- Its cutting speeds and feeds are tables on the sheets (scripts/extract-machining-workbook-tables.js wrote them to CSV) and pictures
-- pasted into the sheets (the Uddeholm Corrax tables, transcribed with their source; measured on that one tool steel, so the material
-- map points only tool steel at them). A range the workbook gives ("110-160") is kept as a Min and a Max; the calculator picks inside it.
--
--   tblTurningConditions      88 rows  Turning!A27:F59 "Turning cutting conditions"
--   tblDrillReamData         486 rows  Reaming!J1:U61 (drilling and reaming speed, feed per hole diameter band)
--   tblHssHoleSpeeds          33 rows  Tapping!A33:D58 (HSS drilling, reaming and tapping speed)
--   tblBoringFeed             12 rows  Boring!K26:L49 (boring feed per hole diameter band)
--   tblMillingConditions      27 rows  End Milling and Sawing!O8:Q61 (milling speed and feed per tooth)
--   tblCorraxCutData          38 rows  Uddeholm Corrax turning, drilling and end milling tables (pictures in the Facing, Step Drilling, Plunge and Slot Milling sheets)
--   tblCuttingToolCost         8 rows  Tool cost and tool life of each sheet, priced from the supplier pictures beside them
--   tblThermalCutFeed         31 rows  Laser Cutting!H2:L32 / Plasma Cutting!H2:L32 (feed and kerf by machine and thickness)
--   tblSawCutRate              1 rows  Laser Cutting!I33:K33 (band saw, 2500 sq. mm/min)
--   tblCuttingMaterialGroup    7 rows  the engine's material classes mapped to each table's own material names
--
-- Staged under source_region USA like every other lookup table (MachiningLookupService reads them by key, for every location);
-- the data is the India workbook's. Tool prices are INR as the workbook gives them.
-- Idempotent: each table is re-set to the CSV.
-- ============================================================================

